usage: preflight.py [-h] --artificial-preflight [--candidate-shadow] repo

Run existing B18 artificial diagnostic behind an explicit production veto. No
new probability/scoring mathematics. No human-data scoring, original-file
writes, network, Git mutations or silent promotion of a diagnostic PASS.

positional arguments:
  repo

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --artificial-preflight
  --candidate-shadow    Opt in to pinned PR28 synthetic shadow; never enables
                        production.
